Hide
Curs Off
Palette $000,$FFF
Paper 0
Pen 1
Cls 0
Print "SUPPLIED SCORE TRACE"
BR_BANKED=0
BR_TOTAL=4
BR_AWARD=BR_TOTAL
BR_BANKED=BR_BANKED+BR_AWARD
Print "First total: ";BR_TOTAL
Print "Secured: ";BR_BANKED
BR_TOTAL=0
Print "Next round starts at: ";BR_TOTAL
Print "Secured stays: ";BR_BANKED
BR_TOTAL=11
BR_AWARD=0
BR_BANKED=BR_BANKED+BR_AWARD
Print "Bust total: ";BR_TOTAL
Print "Bust award: ";BR_AWARD
Print "Secured stays: ";BR_BANKED
Wait Key
Show
End
